    "file": "apps/tabletop/src/client/shapes/cardSwallow.ts",
    "line": 28,
    "summary": "The same unconditional evictPassengers call also runs before the `if (!zoneBounds) return;` guard, so a missing zone-shape bounds early-return still leaves passengers evicted even though nothing else about the swallow (animation, send, delete) ever happens.",
    "failure_scenario": "If editor.getShapePageBounds(zoneHit.id) returns undefined (e.g. the library zone shape was deleted/resized mid-drag), swallowCard evicts the card's passengers and then returns doing nothing else — the card stays exactly where it was dropped, but its counters have already been scattered, with no animation or state change signaling why."
